# Database Migrations (Alembic)

Alembic migrations for the AI Customer Support Worker. The config lives at the
repo root (`alembic.ini`); this directory holds the migration environment
(`env.py`) and revision scripts under `versions/`.

Run from the repo root:

    uv run --project backend alembic upgrade head
    uv run --project backend alembic current
    uv run --project backend alembic check

See `docs/runbook.md` for full instructions.
